1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,247
A spontaneous process happens on its own, without continuous help.

2
00:00:05,247 --> 00:00:08,164
Many spontaneous processes give out heat.

3
00:00:08,164 --> 00:00:09,192
But not all.

4
00:00:09,192 --> 00:00:12,330
Ice melts at room temperature, absorbing heat.

5
00:00:12,330 --> 00:00:16,666
A gas spreads into a vacuum with no energy change at all.

6
00:00:16,666 --> 00:00:18,945
And our cold pack absorbs heat.

7
00:00:18,945 --> 00:00:22,265
So energy is not the only driving force.

